risp, Toss & Serve Fresh","instructionTemplate":"Transfer to the wire rack to drain excess oil for 1–2 minutes while still piping hot, then finish with {m52855_5}, {m52855_6}, and {m52855_7}. Serve Banana Pancakes fresh while the exterior is shatteringly crisp.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Crisp Drain • 4 Servings"}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-52855","handle":"@baker_banana-p","image":"./ai-images/banana-pancakes.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 15 mins!","rating":5}],"isHealthy":true}}]
